1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:03,137
(Sheldon:)Soft kitty, warm kitty

2
00:00:03,383 --> 00:00:07,113
(Sheldon:)Little ball of fur

3
00:00:08,922 --> 00:00:11,822
(Sheldon:)Happy kitty, sleepy kitty

4
00:00:12,025 --> 00:00:14,995
(Sheldon:)Purr, purr, purr

5
00:00:15,328 --> 00:00:17,758
Thank you, Sheldon. That was very nice.

6
00:00:17,964 --> 00:00:20,264
- Want me to sing it again?
- No.

7
00:00:22,769 --> 00:00:26,329
The fourth time was the charm.

8
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:31,710
(Sheldon:)There anything I can get for you?
Some apple juice? Uh, some Jell-O?

9
00:00:31,945 --> 00:00:36,645
No, no, thank you, but I do
have a favor to ask.

10
00:00:37,184 --> 00:00:39,844
- Name it.
- Well, I'm booked to do...

11
00:00:40,053 --> 00:00:42,423
(Arthur:)...a children's party tomorrow...

12
00:00:42,622 --> 00:00:45,492
...and frankly, I don't feel up to it.

13
00:00:45,692 --> 00:00:49,322
(Sheldon:)Oh, you're not. You look awful.

14
00:00:51,798 --> 00:00:55,018
(Raj:)Thank you.

